/**
 * ServiceList Service - Reactive service list data management
 * Handles querying and pagination of services list (NO selection management).
 *
 * Availability is just part of the query: when the query options carry an
 * `availabilityFilter`, the API layer queries services by real bookable
 * availability (and each service gets an `available` flag); otherwise it runs the
 * plain offset query. The service does not know or care which endpoint is used —
 * that decision lives in {@link queryServices}.
 */
